# Production default for the deployed frontend (Vercel).
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_* values are inlined into the client bundle at build time, so
# this is public by definition -- not a secret. It lives in the repo so a
# production build can't silently fall back to the local-dev default
# (http://localhost:8000) if a hosting dashboard's env var is missing, which
# is exactly what happened on the first Vercel deploy.
#
# Precedence: a real environment variable set by the host (Vercel project
# settings) overrides this file, so per-deployment overrides still work.
#
# The /backend suffix is required: the Hugging Face Space serves the API
# under that path (Gradio owns / on that host). See docs/DEPLOYMENT.md.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=https://nsk1718-argus-backend.hf.space/backend
